  "Specification": "Voucher transfer transaction protocol (VTP). Models a source holder (SH), destination holder (DH), and voucher (V) coordinating through prepared/transfer/abort messages. The voucher state remains valid throughout the transfer; only participant states change. Proves type safety, consistency (no source holder transferred while destination holder aborted or vice versa), and refinement of the VoucherLifeCycle specification.",
